  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing access to skills training and mental health expertise for young people in a rural area of Lesotho.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lesotho has the highest suicide rate in the world.  Most people in the country lack access to mental health support.  The project will offer access to mental health expertise and life skills training for young people in Matsieng in order to offer pathways to opportunities and to reduce the risks of negative health outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
